RESPONSIBLE USE

Yaragon is an educational/defensive network-analysis tool. It is intended to
be used ONLY on networks and systems that you own or are explicitly authorized
to test, within an isolated laboratory environment. The authors do not condone
and are not responsible for any misuse. Using Yaragon to intercept or disrupt
traffic on networks you do not own or have permission to test may be illegal.
